{"about_the_game":"You are a harmless goblin who gets involved in a chase by Death. You will have to collect red stones and build your fortress to defend yourself from the enemy hordes until you find Death and finish him.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2>Apply your estategies to build your base and defend yourself from the enemy hordes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976230/extras/567ad7a8ed05ed360b64a3453f59e544.avif?t=1762975521\" width=512 height=606 /></span><br>Your main resource is the red stones found on the map or you can get them in the mine.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976230/extras/01b34bd827579b3cf2df3fd7fb937900.avif?t=1762975521\" width=512 height=618 /></span><br>Build the towers to attack them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976230/extras/928f67f2903e89c284420c0242b76ae7.avif?t=1762975521\" width=512 height=596 /></span><br>Each tower can have an elemental attack of your choice.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976230/extras/0bbe4105cb77a72b927e20c4876d93a2.avif?t=1762975521\" width=512 height=512 /></span><br>Build the walls to protect you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976230/extras/df4141807045eea69e8eb760787c7b4c.avif?t=1762975521\" width=512 height=608 /></span><br>Build the workshop to improve your buildings.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976230/extras/1c002e8775fc98bda5615d067972d8aa.avif?t=1762975521\" width=512 height=608 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dea